@startuml
title DrapeMind · NVIDIA API
actor Cliente
component "Angular / Flutter" as UI
component "FastAPI
HTTP + WebSocket autenticado" as API
component "Agente NVIDIA
Streaming + tools nativas" as Agent
cloud "NVIDIA API" as NVIDIA
component "Herramientas tipadas
Permisos + validación GenUI" as Tools
database PostgreSQL as DB
Cliente --> UI
UI <--> API
API --> Agent
Agent <--> NVIDIA : HTTPS / SSE
Agent --> Tools
Tools --> DB : SQL parametrizado
API --> DB : Carrito y pedidos confirmados por cliente
@enduml
